    {
      "text": "Fig. 8, ‘Evolution of stock data availability for SDG 3.c.1 occupations between the 2018 GHO data release and the 2025 NHWA data release’ (Source: WHO Global Health Workforce Statistics, 2018; WHO National Health Workforce Accounts, 2025). A rotated multi-series bar chart plotting the number of countries (0 to 200) with stock data available for each year from 1990 to 2024 across the four SDG 3.c.1 occupations (medical doctors, nursing and midwifery personnel, dentists, and pharmacists), contrasting baseline availability in the 2018 GHO release with the additional countries gained in the 2025 NHWA data release.",
